# Test: OSPFv2 Segment Routing reception -> install (spec-ospf-ext-5, RFC 8665 §5).
#
# VALIDATES: a received IPv4 Prefix-SID computes the outgoing label from the originator's SRGB
# and emits an mpls-fib push (ingress) + swap (transit) toward the SPF next-hop; unknown-algorithm
# and duplicate Prefix-SIDs and out-of-range indices are ignored.
# PREVENTS: a mislabelled push, an install toward a non-SR next hop, or a leaked SR entry.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run 'TestSRInstallPrefixSIDPushAndSwap|TestSRInstallUnknownAlgorithmIgnored|TestSRInstallDuplicateIgnored|TestSRInstallIndexOutOfRange|TestSRInstallWithdrawsStale' -count=1:timeout=90s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
